# Local deploy config: a copy of wrangler.jsonc with the real (non-secret)
# per-account values filled in (KV namespace id, GitHub OAuth client id). Kept
# out of git so those infra ids never land in the public toolkit repo; the
# committed wrangler.jsonc stays a clean placeholder template. Deploy with
# `npx wrangler deploy -c wrangler.local.jsonc`.
wrangler.local.jsonc
